{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SBaZBbhZosCRMPriPrzyFE","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, here's what I found about Federico Valeri, KIP-1267, and Cluster Mirroring:\\\\n\\\\n## Summary\\\\n\\\\n**Federico Valeri** initiated a discussion thread about **KIP-1267: Cluster Mirroring** on the Apache Kafka mailing list. The corresponding **JIRA issue is KAFKA-20186**.\\\\n\\\\n## Details\\\\n\\\\n**Mailing List Thread** (from `_intake/2026/02/13/mail-d37552be08c2868e8e60d311-f991153e.md`):\\\\n- **Subject**: [DISCUSS] KIP-1267: Cluster Mirroring\\\\n- **From**: Federico Valeri (fedevaleri@gmail.com)\\\\n- **Sent**: February 13, 2026 at 16:45:21 UTC\\\\n- **List**: dev@kafka.apache.org\\\\n- **Content**: Federico introduced Cluster Mirroring as a new Kafka feature enabling native, broker-level topic replication across clusters (built into the broker, unlike MirrorMaker 2 which runs as an external Connect-based tool)\\\\n- **KIP Link**: https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1267%3A+Cluster+Mirroring\\\\n\\\\n**JIRA Issue** (from `_intake/2026/02/13/jira-13642045-created-912d0bb7.md`):\\\\n- **Issue**: KAFKA-20186\\\\n- **Title**: Cluster Mirroring\\\\n- **Reporter & Assignee**: Federico Valeri\\\\n- **Created**: February 13, 2026 at 16:41:42 UTC\\\\n- **Status**: Open\\\\n- **Priority**: Major\\\\n- **Labels**: cluster-mirroring\\\\n- **Description**: Tracks the development of KIP-1267\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"_intake/2026/02/14/mail-f9bc31f1ff6e064dc002fcaf-7dfcb15e.md\\\",\\\"_intake/2026/02/14/mail-bd5caef54cdd12cea3eb00a4-e71f8ece.md\\\",\\\"_intake/2026/02/13/mail-d37552be08c2868e8e60d311-f991153e.md\\\",\\\"_intake/2026/02/13/jira-13642045-created-912d0bb7.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":14.07,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":3,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":41270,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":7568